{"schemaVersion":1,"topic":"IANA","sources":[{"id":"01a1a165-f19d-7319-b729-cfc12241c767","kind":"web","ref":{"kind":"web","sourceId":"01a1a165-f19d-7319-b729-cfc12241c767","revision":1},"questionKeys":["q1"],"title":"Internet Assigned Numbers Authority","url":"https://www.iana.org/","canonical":"https://www.iana.org/","contentHash":"81b0bb6cbb2631c03aaa95c60efc27e88afbaba7c230e901531e785f0716824b","fetchedAt":1793709177035,"publishedAt":null,"status":"ready","excluded":false,"error":null,"truncated":false},{"id":"01a1a165-f8f3-7ec2-9523-ebe4a968120a","kind":"web","ref":{"kind":"web","sourceId":"01a1a165-f8f3-7ec2-9523-ebe4a968120a","revision":1},"questionKeys":["q1"],"title":"什么是 IANA：互联网号码分配机构 - LARUS","url":"https://larus.net/cn/blog/what-is-iana/","canonical":"https://larus.net/cn/blog/what-is-iana/","contentHash":"8695605b076e8e7ac91cf27ab5c9170cde13bd63b0abf9bc3182bdbd1ad6a666","fetchedAt":1793709184663,"publishedAt":1787040946000,"status":"ready","excluded":false,"error":null,"truncated":false}],"findings":[{"questionKey":"q1","kind":"fact","text":"Management of the DNS Root Zone (assignments of ccTLDs and gTLDs) along with other functions such as the .int and .arpa zones.","id":"01a1a166-3ef1-7308-97c4-b10cd8b2ce2c","supports":[{"sourceId":"01a1a165-f19d-7319-b729-cfc12241c767","quote":"Management of the DNS Root Zone (assignments of ccTLDs and gTLDs) along with other functions such as the .int and .arpa zones.","start":14,"end":140,"quoteHash":"1bb3636e3a168475535b256325b2d0cc9b464ae1feac15b7282f9f9773622ee3"}],"opposes":[],"distinctSourceGroups":1},{"questionKey":"q1","kind":"fact","text":"互联网由各自独立的网络组成，却需要使用同一套名称、号码和协议标识。IANA 负责协调这些标识，让不同网络能够准确地识别彼此。对 ISP、云平台和托管服务商来说，这套共同记录是客户连接的基础；真正把地址接入网络、把服务交付给客户，则是运营商和地址供应商的工作。","id":"01a1a166-3ef2-71ac-82d1-2a89b9d2a90d","supports":[{"sourceId":"01a1a165-f8f3-7ec2-9523-ebe4a968120a","quote":"互联网由各自独立的网络组成，却需要使用同一套名称、号码和协议标识。IANA 负责协调这些标识，让不同网络能够准确地识别彼此。对 ISP、云平台和托管服务商来说，这套共同记录是客户连接的基础；真正把地址接入网络、把服务交付给客户，则是运营商和地址供应商的